SUMMARY:MIT Music Tech Speaker Series Presents: Mark Ethier
LOCATION:MIT\, 182 MEMORIAL DR (REAR)\, Cambridge\, MA 02139
DESCRIPTION:Tools for Musicians in the Age of AI: From iZotope to Berklee M
 usic and technology have always co-evolved. Long before the synthesizer\, 
 innovations ranging from new tuning systems to the piano's sustain pedal h
 aven’t just made music easier to produce — they’ve fundamentally cha
 nged what kind of music is possible to make. How will AI as an underlying 
 technology fit into this history?\nhttps://calendar.mit.edu/event/mit-musi
 c-tech-speaker-series-presents-mark-ethier\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://p
 ushpin.city/
URL:https://calendar.mit.edu/event/mit-music-tech-speaker-series-presents-m
 ark-ethier
END:VEVENT
