SUMMARY:Author Ted Chiang in Conversation with MIT President Sally Kornblut
 h
LOCATION:MIT\, 160 MEMORIAL DR\, Cambridge\, MA 02139
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special conversation with author Ted Chiang and M
 IT President Sally Kornbluth about Exhalation. President Kornbluth has cho
 sen Chiang’s celebrated science fiction short story collection to celebr
 ate 10 years of MIT Reads. Exploring the book’s provocative questions ab
 out technology and humanity\, their discussion will focus on the stories "
 The Truth of Fact\, the Truth of Feeling\,” "The Lifecycle of Software O
 bjects\,” “Omphalos\,” “What’s Expected of Us\," and "Exhalation
 ."\nhttps://calendar.mit.edu/event/author-ted-chiang-in-conversation-with-
 mit-president-sally-kornbluth\nFrom Pushpin Boston: https://pushpin.city/
